    // Using a loop to run the same code on multiple variables
    for (auto& var : {a, b, c}) {
        processVariable(var);
    }

    return 0;
}
```

This approach is more flexible and reusable, as you can easily add or modify the code in the `processVariable` function without having to change the loop.

